  ('hsmv-83039', 'Application for Disabled Person Parking Permit (HSMV 83039) — top section by you; medical certification by a physician (MD/DO), physician assistant, chiropractor, podiatrist, advanced-practice RN, or optometrist (sight conditions only). Signature must be dated within the last 12 months.', '', 'optional_upload', '{}'),
