  ('org-feid-or-fl-sales-tax', 'Organization''s federal employer ID (FEID) OR Florida sales-tax registration number — one of these is required and will be affixed to the permit', 'Sunbiz registration is NOT an accepted identifier for placard organizational applicants — use FEID or FL sales-tax number only.', 'optional_upload', '{}'),
